cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this evaluation harness or the BKP-500 benchmark, please cite as below."
title: "BKP-500: Bharat Knowledge Probe"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark and evaluation harness for measuring whether large language models know
  India-specific locale conventions — Indian numeral magnitudes and digit grouping,
  state-specific land units, traditional mass units, the Indian fiscal year, agricultural
  crop seasons, and structural identifiers (PAN, GSTIN, IFSC, PIN) — as distinct from general
  arithmetic competence, via matched internationally-framed control-twin items.
authors:
  - name: "Sthanika AI"
date-released: 2026-08-28
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sthanika-ai/Bharat-Knowledge-Probe-Benchmark"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/sthanika-ai/Bharat-Knowledge-Probe-Benchmark"
keywords:
